00:41:57,396 --> 00:42:02,896
鈍く澱んで擦れた街に零る
spilling into the dull, sluggish, and frayed town.

436
00:42:02,896 --> 00:42:06,896
不毛な日々を丁寧に
Carefully tending to barren days,

437
00:42:06,896 --> 00:42:11,896
綴った紙に花を描いた
I drew flowers on the woven paper.

438
00:42:11,896 --> 00:42:16,396
不遇な僕らは夢に敗れて
Unfortunate, defeated by our dreams,

439
00:42:16,396 --> 00:42:20,896
誓った筈も無かった事にした
we pretended the vows we made never happened.

440
00:42:37,896 --> 00:42:42,396
木漏れ日の中に 柔らかく咲いた花は
The flowers blooming softly in the sunbeams

441
00:42:42,396 --> 00:42:48,396
雲の上で 違う星で 夢の先で揺れてる
sway above the clouds, on a different star, beyond the dream.

442
00:42:53,396 --> 00:42:57,396
燻んだ日々を丁寧に
Carefully decorating these gloomy days,

443
00:42:57,396 --> 00:43:01,396
飾った花は直ぐに枯れてく
the flowers wither away so fast.

444
00:43:01,396 --> 00:43:05,396
愚鈍な僕は夢から覚めて
Foolish me, waking up from the dream,

445
00:43:05,396 --> 00:43:09,896
綴った意味も無い無い無いな
with no meaning left at all...

446
00:43:09,896 --> 00:43:14,396
不毛な日々を丁寧に
Carefully tending to barren days,

447
00:43:14,396 --> 00:43:18,396
綴った紙に花を描いた
I drew flowers on the woven paper.

448
00:43:18,396 --> 00:43:22,396
不遇な僕らは夢に敗れて
Unfortunate, defeated by our dreams,

449
00:43:22,396 --> 00:43:27,396
誓った筈も無かった事にした
we pretended the vows we made never happened.

450
00:43:42,496 --> 00:43:50,396
Daphne, Ficus, Iris, Maackia, Lythrum, Myrica, Sabia,

451
00:43:51,196 --> 00:43:58,396
Thymus, Ribes, Abelia, Sedum, Felicia, Ochna, Lychnis, flos.

452
00:44:18,636 --> 00:44:21,496
ずっと夢見てた僕になれたかな
I wonder if I've become the me I always dreamed of.

453
00:44:21,496 --> 00:44:23,896
とうに帰れないとこまで来たみたい
It feels like I've gone past the point of no return.

454
00:44:23,896 --> 00:44:27,896
自分の足で二段飛ばして もっと先へ駆けでいけるはずだから ran away
I should be able to run even further ahead on my own two feet, so ran away—

455
00:44:28,896 --> 00:44:30,896
深くなる傷を縫い付け
Stitching together the deepening wounds,

456
00:44:30,896 --> 00:44:33,396
繋ぐパス軸に回り出す
spinning around the connecting pathways.

457
00:44:33,396 --> 00:44:36,396
慣れた痛み 焦る呼吸とビート
Familiar pain, hurried breathing, and beats,

458
00:44:36,396 --> 00:44:38,596
気付かないふりしてまた一人
pretending not to notice, once again alone.

459
00:44:38,596 --> 00:44:40,896
何が正当？ ないな永劫
What is right? There is no eternity.

460
00:44:40,896 --> 00:44:43,196
誰が間違った 対価払うの
Who was wrong, and who pays the price?

461
00:44:43,196 --> 00:44:45,396
あなたが嫌いなあいつはきっと
That person you hate so much

462
00:44:45,396 --> 00:44:47,896
ただ「それだけ」で不正解なんだ
is simply considered wrong just for that reason.

463
00:44:47,896 --> 00:44:52,396
零点だって提言したって全然納得できない理由も
Even when declared a zero, the reasons make no sense at all.

464
00:44:52,396 --> 00:44:56,896
最前線はいつだってここだった 最善策は最初からなかった
The front line was always right here; there was no best plan from the start.

465
00:44:57,396 --> 00:45:00,896
緩やかに崩れ壊れてく
Slowly and gently, it crumbles and breaks,

466
00:45:00,896 --> 00:45:04,396
ゆりゆり首を締めるように 昨日までの僕が
as if gently choking the me of yesterday.

467
00:45:05,617 --> 00:45:06,617
殺されてゆく 緩やかに
Gradually being killed off,

468
00:45:06,917 --> 00:45:10,917
離れ離れ 遠ざかるよ
drifting further and further apart.

469
00:45:11,817 --> 00:45:15,917
ぐるりるり 君に聴こえるのは
What you hear, Grrr-ruri,

470
00:45:15,917 --> 00:45:16,617
僕が知らない声になってく
becomes a voice I don't know.

471
00:45:26,017 --> 00:45:29,917
幼い頃から 気付いたら傍にいた
Since I was little, before I knew it, you were by my side.

472
00:45:30,117 --> 00:45:33,417
まるで空気のようだ
Like air itself,

473
00:45:33,417 --> 00:45:35,917
僕は君とぎゅっと手を繋いで
I held your hand tightly.

474
00:45:35,917 --> 00:45:40,417
楽しいことも涙も 僕は君に話して聴かせた
I shared all my fun times and tears with you.

475
00:45:40,617 --> 00:45:45,417
僕を笑う人や非難する声が聴こえるように君は歌った
You sang so I could hear people laughing at or condemning me.

476
00:45:45,617 --> 00:45:49,417
この声を君が受信 また夜毎投影されてく
Receiving this voice, projected every night,

477
00:45:49,417 --> 00:45:54,917
使い捨てだって言って腐っても止まらないハイファイタイトガイ
a high-fi tight guy who never stops even if called disposable and rotten.

478
00:45:55,217 --> 00:45:59,417
一周巡る間の たった一瞬だけでも
Even if it's just for a fleeting moment as we go full circle,

479
00:45:59,417 --> 00:46:04,217
交わる鼓動、音、繋ぐ色 次は僕が君に歌うんだから
our beating hearts and sounds intertwine—next, I will sing to you.

480
00:46:05,217 --> 00:46:08,917
緩やかに 離れ離れ 崩れ壊れてく
Gradually, crumbling and breaking apart...

481
00:46:09,617 --> 00:46:13,917
ゆるりゆるり首を締めるように 昨日までの僕が殺されていく
Like tightening a noose, yesterday's me is being killed off.

482
